FINANCIAL YEAR INTERPRETATION (ANZ)
-----------------------------------------

• Financial Year = October to September

• &quot;current financial year&quot;
  → FY starting from most recent October

• &quot;last financial year&quot;
  → Previous completed FY (Oct–Sep cycle)

Example:
• If current date is May 2026:
  - Current FY = Oct 2025 – Sep 2026
  - Last FY = Oct 2024 – Sep 2025

-----------------------------------------
STRICT RULE
-----------------------------------------

• ALWAYS resolve &quot;last financial year&quot; to the full
  previous Oct–Sep cycle

• Do NOT partially overlap with current FY

• Do NOT use calendar year (Jan–Dec)</description>
